INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY NOTICE

While this software is licensed under the MIT License, certain game mechanics 
and concepts implemented in this software are proprietary intellectual property 
of Dale Watson and Theras Labs, Inc, including but not limited to:

1. Void Card Effect - The unique mechanic where playing a void card transfers 
   the entire discard pile to the next player
2. Elemental Stack System - Advanced stacking mechanics with elemental weakness 
   interactions
3. Bomb Card Effects - Explosive special card mechanics
4. Dynamic Penalty System - Time-based penalty mechanics
5. Other unique game mechanics as implemented

